### --------------------------------------------------------
### Token Endpoints — App-Level (Tier 1)
### Requires: X-Security, X-App-Name
### --------------------------------------------------------

### Verify a token
POST {{$dotenv HOST}}/tokens/verify
Content-Type: application/json
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: myapp

{
  "token": "myapp_PASTE_RAW_TOKEN_HERE",
  "userId": "user-001"
}

### Update token metadata
PATCH {{$dotenv HOST}}/tokens/metadata
Content-Type: application/json
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: myapp

{
  "token": "myapp_PASTE_RAW_TOKEN_HERE",
  "metadata": {
    "role": "admin",
    "note": "promoted"
  }
}

### --------------------------------------------------------
### Token Endpoints — Operator (Tier 2)
### Requires: X-Security, X-App-Name (admin), X-Operator-Key
### --------------------------------------------------------

### List all tokens (paginated)
GET {{$dotenv HOST}}/tokens?page=1&limit=10
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

### List tokens — filter by app
GET {{$dotenv HOST}}/tokens?appName=myapp&status=active
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

### List tokens — filter by user
GET {{$dotenv HOST}}/tokens?userId=user-001
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

### Get token detail by ID
GET {{$dotenv HOST}}/tokens/1
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}

### Revoke a token by ID
POST {{$dotenv HOST}}/tokens/1/revoke
X-Security: {{$dotenv SECURITY_KEY}}
X-App-Name: {{$dotenv ADMIN_APP_NAME}}
X-Operator-Key: {{$dotenv OPERATOR_KEY}}
